  "phase_2_engagement_widget_research": {
    "objective": "Decide Reaction Bar wording, and whether Poll or Quiz genuinely fits this post — or neither. This is a judgment call grounded in phase_1's actual research findings, never a default, never forced, never invented content.",
    "reaction_bar": {
      "default_behavior": "Renders on every post automatically even with no frontmatter written — hardcoded fallback is Obsessed / Meh / Hard pass. No action needed by default.",
      "when_to_customize": "Only write a custom reaction block when phase_1's specific entity/sentiment genuinely earns sharper wording than the generic default — e.g. a specific technique-reaction framing that the generic options would flatten. This is the exception, not the rule. Do not customize reflexively on every post.",
